---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Caregiver Organization | Aging at Home Lab" description="Caregiver binder pages, emergency contact sheets, medication lists, appointment notes, and family coordination tools.">
  <article class="prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Caregiver Organization</p>
    <h1>Turn scattered care details into a system.</h1>
    <p>Caregiving becomes harder when medications, contacts, appointments, documents, and responsibilities are scattered across phones, drawers, texts, and memory. This section focuses on practical organization tools families can actually use.</p>

    <h2>Planned resources</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Family Caregiver Binder: What to Include</li>
      <li>Medication List Template for Caregivers</li>
      <li>Doctor Appointment Notes Template</li>
      <li>Emergency Contact Sheet for Aging Parents</li>
      <li>Caregiver Calendar Template</li>
      <li>How to Coordinate Care Between Siblings</li>
      <li>Hospital Go-Bag Checklist for Older Adults</li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
